(text "CTRL_READY = CORE_RESET_OK AND PC7. U103 retains Schmitt conditioning of the slow NRST RC.\nROM boot can configure pins used as inverter PWM / ENABLE. PC7 is not used by the G431 ROM loader.\nAt reset or while running ROM, R402 holds PC7 LOW and the power base remains disabled.\nFirmware must initialize safe PWM / BKIN first, then explicitly assert RUN_ARM and ENABLE.\nClear RUN_ARM before software jumping to ROM. This is not a watchdog or CPU-halt detector." (at 20.32 165.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0de81e69-37cd-5fa5-b94e-1bd5b359ec54"))
